  "split_policy": "Duplicated databases are ordered by db_id. Their primary, secondary, and remaining value groups are assigned cyclically to suffixes _1, _2, and _3 using rotation offsets 0, 1, and 2. The rotation only relabels the groups; child rows referencing removed parent rows are removed recursively.",
